  "scope": "Unchanged230-bit T80 donor with new VHDL clean-fetch capture/bus wrapper. Synthetic native VHDL program compares normal bus timing/address/writes against original production T80se, then tests three400-write continuations with both register banks, live R/I reads, R bit7/wrap and periodic IRQ. Prefix/EI admission guards, acquisition cancellation, alternate bank reload, complementary writes to all238used bits, full256-bit image and RAM restore, three512-clock HALT continuations/IRQ wakes and pendingEI+IRQ request deferred to safe acknowledged IRQ entry and its continuation are checked for each selected IM. Board NMI/BUSRQ are tied inactive; this is not an all-microstate/general NMI/ISA proof, real soundROM comparison, production sound bus, Quartus fit or full game restore."
